  m_text: "Stonebeak Fledgling\n\r\nHealth: 7 \nMana Cost: 5              \nAttack:
    6\n\r\nAbility 1: Stone Skin - The creature's stony hide temporarily hardens,
    reducing all incoming damage by 2 for one turn. (Mana Cost: 3)\n\r\nAbility 2:
    Rocky Gale - The creature flaps its broad, heavy wings, sending forth a gust
    of wind and small stone fragments that deal 4 damage to all opposing creatures.
    (Mana Cost: 7)\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
